# Font Files Directory

Place your font files here:
- Poppins-Regular.ttf
- Poppins-Medium.ttf
- Poppins-SemiBold.ttf
- Poppins-Bold.ttf
- Inter-Regular.ttf
- Inter-Medium.ttf
- Montserrat-Regular.ttf
- Montserrat-Bold.ttf

You can download these fonts from:
- Google Fonts: https://fonts.google.com/
- Or use system fonts as fallback (app will work without custom fonts)
